  "evidence": "TEXT_G: Leave the EU to restore sovereignty and border control; repeal the Human Rights Act and leave the ECHR; five‑year freeze and long‑term cap on immigration with no amnesties and tougher asylum; end state promotion of multiculturalism; zero‑tolerance policing, life means life, double prison capacity, three‑strikes, boot camps; restrict burqa/niqab in public buildings; deport radical preachers; reinstate Treason Act; explicit civic nationalism and defence of traditional institutions (monarchy/Church); large defence build‑up and maintain/replace Trident.\nTEXT_E: Europe “referendum lock” and never join the Euro but remain in the EU; tougher knife sentencing, elected police commissioners, Border Police Force; recognise marriage/civil partnerships in tax; renew Trident; but also scrap ID cards, scale back vetting, limit DNA retention (civil‑liberties emphasis) and strong green agenda (80% emissions cut, Green Deal).",
